      "content": "But \"consensus\" can be a strong word. Some people point to specific issues like signature verification flaws or vulnerabilities in ballot drop boxes as proof that the whole thing is sketchy. Are you saying those specific concerns are just wrong, or are you just avoiding saying that the system has real, exploitable holes?",
